      "category": "Spirituality",
      "type": "mental-model",
      "headline": "The Direct Path Framework (Ekayano Maggo)",
      "body": "Satipatthana is described as the direct path to clearing sorrow and winning freedom. It does not demand exotic retreats; it asks only that you see what is here, right now, as it is.",
